OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew this had been worth it -
OL,4,Awe had finally got attention'
OL,5,
OL,6,FExactly 10 years ago, Jenny Hockney and
OL,7,FFreda Brayshaw hit the headlines when
OL,8,Fthey were arrested while trying to stop
OL,9,Ftrees being cut down in a Sheffield
OL,10,Fstreet after contractors arrived at
OL,11,Fdawn to fell them.
OL,13,F"When we saw these notices on our trees
OL,14,Fthat said they would be cut down in two
OL,15,Fweeks we were horrified," remembers
OL,16,FJenny Hockney a decade later.
OL,18,F"We were living under this threat, so
OL,19,Fwe knew something was imminent."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
