OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew this had been worth it -
OL,4,Awe had finally got attention'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny, now 80, and Freda, now 81, were
OL,7,Ffriends and neighbours who lived on
OL,8,FRustlings Road, a street opposite
OL,9,FEndcliffe Park, which was then lined
OL,10,Fwith mature trees.
